port audio/csound
type port
reason "DragonFly: follow FreeBSD's __FreeBSD__ branches now that USES=alias is gone"
target @any

# FreeBSD's patches key two fixes on __FreeBSD__, which USES=alias used to
# define for us: Top/csound.c defines PTHREAD_SPINLOCK_INITIALIZER (which
# no BSD has; csound uses it once configure finds pthread_spin_lock), and
# H/remote.h includes <net/if.h> for struct ifreq. dragonfly/@2026Q4 and
# @main add __DragonFly__ to both.
